OlivineCity_Interior2_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "Crossing the sea?\n"
	.string "Then listen up!\p"
	.string "There are whirlpools on the way\n"
	.string "to CIANWOOD.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON must know a special\n"
	.string "move to get over the whirlpools.$"

OlivineCity_Interior2_Text_Sailor_1::
	.string "Hah! Your POKéMON sure look like\n"
	.string "lightweights!\p"
	.string "They don’t have the power to move\n"
	.string "boulders aside.\p"
	.string "Here, use this and teach them\n"
	.string "STRENGTH!\p"
	.string "You’ll need GOLDENROD’s GYM\n"
	.string "BADGE to use that outside battles.$"

OlivineCity_Interior2_Text_Sailor_2::
	.string "On the sea, the only thing you can\n"
	.string "count on is your own good self!\p"
	.string "I’m so proud of my buff bod!$"
